---
// Services — one-at-a-time accordion (toggle + aria sync wired in interactions.ts).
---
<section class="sec" id="services">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <div class="reveal">
        <span class="kicker">What we do</span>
        <h2 class="sec-title">Services, end to end.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="lead reveal" data-d="1">From a single automation to a full product and brand. Pick a lane — or hand us the whole problem.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="svc-wrap reveal" id="svcWrap">
      <div class="svc open">
        <button class="svc-head" type="button" aria-expanded="true">
          <span class="svc-no">01</span>
          <span class="svc-name">Automation</span>
          <span class="svc-toggle"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span>
        </button>
        <div class="svc-body"><div class="svc-body-in"><div class="svc-detail">
          <p>Kill the repetitive work. We connect your tools, scrape and clean data, and build scheduled bots and pipelines that run themselves — observable, reliable, and documented.</p>
          <div class="svc-skills"><span class="tagchip">Workflows</span><span class="tagchip">Scraping</span><span class="tagchip">Integrations</span><span class="tagchip">Pipelines</span></div>
        </div></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="svc">
        <button class="svc-head" type="button" aria-expanded="false">
          <span class="svc-no">02</span>
          <span class="svc-name">Product development</span>
          <span class="svc-toggle"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span>
        </button>
        <div class="svc-body"><div class="svc-body-in"><div class="svc-detail">
          <p>From idea to shipped product — web apps, APIs, dashboards and SaaS tools, architected to scale and built to last.</p>
          <div class="svc-skills"><span class="tagchip">Full-stack</span><span class="tagchip">APIs</span><span class="tagchip">SaaS</span><span class="tagchip">Cloud</span></div>
        </div></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="svc">
        <button class="svc-head" type="button" aria-expanded="false">
          <span class="svc-no">03</span>
          <span class="svc-name">Web &amp; app design</span>
          <span class="svc-toggle"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span>
        </button>
        <div class="svc-body"><div class="svc-body-in"><div class="svc-detail">
          <p>Get online with a site that actually converts. Design, build, deploy and host — your brand, live and fast, end to end.</p>
          <div class="svc-skills"><span class="tagchip">UI/UX</span><span class="tagchip">Sites</span><span class="tagchip">Branding</span><span class="tagchip">Hosting</span></div>
        </div></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="svc">
        <button class="svc-head" type="button" aria-expanded="false">
          <span class="svc-no">04</span>
          <span class="svc-name">Consulting</span>
          <span class="svc-toggle"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span>
        </button>
        <div class="svc-body"><div class="svc-body-in"><div class="svc-detail">
          <p>Stuck on architecture, tooling or scaling? Bring in our team — audits, technical direction and hands-on pairing with your developers.</p>
          <div class="svc-skills"><span class="tagchip">Architecture</span><span class="tagchip">Audits</span><span class="tagchip">Mentoring</span></div>
        </div></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
